  message: "Implemented in commit c01512b82 (same commit as WI-rofuv, sibling deliverables). Replacement sequence: vendor-specific graceful exit keystroke via tmux send-keys, 30s poll of kill -0 <cli_pid>, hard-kill tmux session + direct invocation of kill-transcript-sync.sh + rotate-on-session-end.sh on timeout. Fresh spawn via tmux new-session -d -s <new> -e HYPERGUMBO_RESPAWN=1 <cli>. Tests cover graceful-exit path, hard-kill fallback, unknown-vendor default, and HYPERGUMBO_RESPAWN=1 env injection. See CHANGELOG [Unreleased]."  # ccd0
